      <h2>Admizz's own published figures</h2>
      <p>The following are figures Admizz Education has published on its own site (admizzeducation.com) — real and attributed, but self-reported rather than independently audited. We cite them as Admizz's own stated results, not as verified third-party fact, matching the "Figures published by Admizz Education, as of 2026" attribution shown wherever they appear on this site.</p>
